OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fclear through the evening to bring a
OL,7,Fdry night with some clear spells, but
OL,8,Fstrong winds and coastal gales will
OL,9,Fcontinue into the evening. The winds
OL,10,Fwill then ease through the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FStorm Boelo quickly arriving
OL,13,Fto bring a very wet and windy day with
OL,14,Fheavy and persistent rain developing
OL,15,Fand disruptive winds, these reaching
OL,16,Fsevere gale force along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
