OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fstrong, disruptive winds continue
OL,7,Fthrough Sunday, and scattered showers
OL,8,Fmainly around the northwest. Remaining
OL,9,Funsettled into next week with further
OL,10,Fperiods of rain, showers, and strong
OL,11,Fwinds.
